  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil.<br>• Finely chop garlic.<br>• Slice lemon into wedges.<br>• Pick and finely chop rosemary.<br>• Halve snacking tomatoes. <br>• Thinly slice flat mushrooms. </p> <p><br>TIP: Run your fingers down the rosemary stalk to <br>remove the leaves easily. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-75292600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p> Cook fettuccine in the boiling water until <br>‘al dente’, 11 minutes. Reserve some pasta water<br>(see ingredients), then drain and return pasta to <br>the saucepan. Add a drizzle of olive oil to prevent <br>the pasta sticking together. </p>\n• <p><br>TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly <br>firm in the centre. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-bd309c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the pasta is cooking, heat a large frying pan <br>over medium-high heat with the butter and a drizzle <br>of olive oil. Cook mushrooms, tomatoes and <br>rosemary, stirring until tender, 6-8 minutes.<br>• Add garlic, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-ebca4620.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To the pan with the mushrooms, add light cooking <br>cream, herb &amp; mushroom seasoning and the <br>reserved pasta water. Stir to combine and simmer <br>until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-0ddb2030.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Remove pan from the heat, then add fettuccine, the <br>pepper and half the Parmesan cheese. Gently toss <br>to combine. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-5d646940.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide creamy mushroom and rosemary fettuccine <br>between bowls.<br>• Top with remaining Parmesan cheese. <br>• Serve with lemon wedges. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-2b5b8850.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
